        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Super Furry Animals, Social Distortion\n- People: Gruff Rhys, Huw Bunford, Guto Pryce, Cian Ciaran, Dafydd Ieuan, Mike Ness, Jonny Wickersham, Brent Harding, David Hidalgo Jr., David Kalish\n- Places: Cardiff, Wales\n- Roles: lead vocals, guitar, lead guitar, bass guitar, keyboards, synthesisers, electronics, drums, backing vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Super Furry Animals formed in Cardiff, Wales in 1993.\n- Since 1993, Super Furry Animals has consisted of Gruff Rhys on lead vocals and guitar.\n- Since 1993, Super Furry Animals has consisted of Huw Bunford on lead guitar and vocals, Guto Pryce on bass guitar, Cian Ciaran on keyboards, synthesisers, various electronics, occasional guitar and vocals, and Dafydd Ieuan on drums and vocals.\n- Social Distortion currently consists of Mike Ness on lead vocals and lead guitar, Jonny Wickersham on rhythm guitar and backing vocals, Brent Harding on bass and backing vocals, David Hidalgo Jr. on drums, and David Kalish on keyboards.",
